-- title:
--   Original discounted stopped reward with two physical centred noises, including full negative marks
-- statement:
--   For finite negative jump activity and a bounded original stopping time, retain the original full Stieltjes cash, correct ruin-contact branch, source Gaussian R and full compensated negative-mark martingale Jfull. Jfull has integrable stopped value and conditional expectation zero at time zero. This applies Proved original fullmark ruin-clipped two noise reserve result and is the fullmark physical alternative to incomplete smallmark-only B219 mesh.

